1
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:12,080
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,120
=Episode 20=

3
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,000
Hey, wait.

4
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,640
Send me the location.

5
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,760
I need to stop by
the dance company tomorrow.

6
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,080
I'll head straight there
from the company.

7
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:20,800
It's close to the company anyway.

8
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,360
I have to pick up Shuqi anyway.

9
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:23,720
I can pick you up too.

10
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,160
I'll send He Lan the location too.

11
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:26,280
We'll meet

12
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:26,800
at the restaurant.

13
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,080
Isn't that Xiyu's bag?

14
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,600
You must be wondering

15
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,440
where Luo Xiyu is right now.

16
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:52,120
I'll send you her location.

17
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,960
If you dare call the police,

18
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,440
I will kill Luo Xiyu.

19
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:04,360
You okay?

20
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:05,000
I'm fine.

21
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:12,200
Where's Zhang Jinghang?

22
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:14,120
By now,

23
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,440
he should have met up with Li Junsheng.

24
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,240
Then let's go.

25
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,240
Li Junsheng.

26
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,120
What did you do to Xiyu?

27
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,160
Still worried about her?

28
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,720
If you've got a problem, come after me.

29
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:41,040
What kind of man goes after a girl?

30
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:43,160
You are the one I'm after!

31
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:45,400
If I hadn't tied her up,

32
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:47,200
would you have walked
right into my trap?

33
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:49,080
What do you want?

34
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:52,320
Pretty boy,

35
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:54,200
don't be scared.

36
00:01:54,640 --> 00:01:55,480
Your daddy

37
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,760
will be here to pay your ransom soon.

38
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:10,000
You Zhang men

39
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,760
sure are hopeless romantics.

40
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,320
But if you ask me,

41
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:14,440
you're no match for your dad.

42
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,920
At least he did it for his own wife.

43
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:17,960
But you?

44
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,040
You're always pining
for someone else's girl.

45
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:21,080
You...

46
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:22,560
What are you talking about?

47
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:23,600
Xiyu...

48
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:25,400
She's just a good friend.

49
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,080
Let me tell you something.

50
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,240
I've tailed you several times.

51
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,120
Every time,

52
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:36,400
you claimed you were there
to see Song Shuqi perform.

53
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,360
But your phone?

54
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,640
It was full of creepshots of Luo Xiyu!

55
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:41,280
Hey,

56
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,800
would you dare let He Lan find out?

57
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:43,400
Huh?

58
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,880
You're despicable.

59
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,720
I'm despicable?

60
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,080
Your dad's the despicable one!

61
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,720
He was the one

62
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:52,880
making generic drugs
and selling them for profit.

63
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,240
I only sold them once!

64
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:54,680
Fine.

65
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,480
Call it bad luck.

66
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,440
And then what?

67
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,320
He pinned the whole thing on me!

68
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:01,120
I spent ten years in prison!

69
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,200
I nearly lost my sight!

70
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,120
You know that?

71
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:05,720
Now that I'm out,

72
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,600
if he knows what's good for him,

73
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:09,840
he'll come pay me what he owes me.

74
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,080
Your mom's dead now.

75
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,120
And you're Zhang Jichuan's

76
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:21,120
only son.

77
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:23,960
I doubt he'd let you die

78
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,880
just to save a little money.

79
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:33,360
Li Junsheng!

80
00:03:35,080 --> 00:03:35,840
Let my son go.

81
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:37,360
Dad!

82
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,920
That was fast.

83
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,800
See? I told you.

84
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,840
Even a tiger won't eat its own cub.

85
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:45,480
I brought the money.

86
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,600
Don't do anything rash.

87
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,680
Don't give it to him.

88
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,440
Throw the money over here.

89
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:51,560
Untie him first.

90
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:53,040
Shut up and do what I say!

91
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,240
Throw it over here!

92
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:57,920
Fine.

93
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,120
Count it.

94
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,160
Then let him go.

95
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:27,920
Zhang Jichuan!

96
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:28,960
You fricking tricked me?

97
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:36,960
Hurry!

98
00:04:37,080 --> 00:04:37,600
Go!

99
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:38,920
Watch out!

100
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,240
Are the police almost here?

101
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,680
Scum like you

102
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:48,880
doesn't deserve to live.

103
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,360
Take your darn money and rot in hell!

104
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:51,920
Zhang...

105
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:54,920
Stop!

106
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,440
I called the police.

107
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:02,640
Don't kill him.

108
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:03,600
He Lan?

109
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:05,080
You called the police?

110
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,720
Xiyu?

111
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:08,800
What are you doing here?

112
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,080
Li Junsheng is here.

113
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:14,640
How did you find Xiyu?

114
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,160
You were all in on this, weren't you?

115
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:19,440
What are you talking about?

116
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,200
Dad!

117
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,040
Run, now!

118
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:21,880
Zhang Jichuan!

119
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,160
You can't leave.

120
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,840
It's not too late to turn yourself in.

121
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,280
If you don't,

122
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,600
you'll only end up dead.

123
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:28,200
He Lan,

124
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,040
my mom's already gone.

125
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,960
My dad's all I have left.

126
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,480
I won't let him go to prison!

127
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,720
I'm trying to save you!

128
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:37,040
No.

129
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,280
I have a boat to catch.

130
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,960
I'm not going to prison!

131
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,520
You can't get on that boat!

132
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:42,400
Your boat...

133
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:46,840
Zhang Jinghang!

134
00:05:47,280 --> 00:05:48,000
Let my dad go.

135
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:50,840
Or I'll stab her to death.

136
00:05:53,440 --> 00:05:54,240
Zhang Jinghang,

137
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:56,760
it really was you.

138
00:05:57,680 --> 00:05:58,120
Shut up.

139
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,120
You really would do this.

140
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:00,320
Shut up!

141
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:01,840
All of you, shut up!

142
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,360
You drove me to this.

143
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:05,880
There's no going back now.

144
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:11,360
Xiyu,

145
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,440
I've always liked you.

146
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,320
But you kept ignoring my feelings.

147
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:19,360
I don't understand.

148
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,160
How could everything happen
on the same day?

149
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,760
You got together with He Lan,

150
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:26,680
and somehow I ended up with Song Shuqi.

151
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:29,240
I had no choice but to treat you
as a friend.

152
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:31,960
But...

153
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:36,760
why did you have to interfere
in my life?

154
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:37,800
You reported me.

155
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,000
My dad had to flee the country.

156
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,920
He didn't even get to see my mom
one last time.

157
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,920
Why do you still have to go after him?

158
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,840
Why?

159
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,720
Are you cops?

160
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,120
Why is any of this your business?

161
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:50,600
We've been friends all these years.

162
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,080
How could you be this heartless?

163
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:53,480
True.

164
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,800
So a few people died from the drugs.

165
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,840
But how many families

166
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:00,920
did my dad's medicine save?

167
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,520
My dad

168
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,920
was their beacon of hope!

169
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:07,920
But now,

170
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:09,840
I've got nowhere left to go.

171
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,000
Happy now?

172
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,560
Hypocrites.

173
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,520
You're all darn hypocrites!

174
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:18,600
Zhang Jinghang.

175
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,080
Put the knife down first.

176
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:24,080
I'll let your dad go.

177
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:25,200
You let Xiyu go.

178
00:07:25,520 --> 00:07:26,040
Dad,

179
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:27,640
go.

180
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:31,080
Go!

181
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:39,680
Zhang Jinghang.

182
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,120
Xiyu,

183
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:46,920
goodbye.

184
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,120
(Don't move!)

185
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:52,960
Xiyu.

186
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:16,960
(Last night,)

187
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,120
(after fishermen alerted police,)

188
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:19,000
(a stolen fishing boat)

189
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:20,680
(was discovered in the South China Sea.)

190
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:21,480
(The vessel, Justice,)

191
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:24,080
(encountered a storm
twenty nautical miles)

192
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:25,280
(from international waters)

193
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,840
(and unfortunately capsized.)

194
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,880
(A passing vessel spotted the wreck)

195
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:29,760
(A Boat Found in the South China Sea)
(and launched a rescue.)

196
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:32,080
(Stolen Fishing Boat "Justice")
(A 55-year-old man aboard)

197
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,120
(the Justice)

198
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,520
(was killed in the accident.)

199
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:42,280
(Swan Lake
Luo Xiyu, Principal Dancer)

200
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,440
I feel so bad for Song Shuqi's
boyfriend.

201
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:31,360
He had such a bright future
ahead of him,

202
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,160
and then,

203
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,720
just like that, he ended up behind bars.

204
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:34,960
Yeah.

205
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,600
He could get three years
for harboring a criminal.

206
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,960
His dad really ruined his life.

207
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,920
Have you seen Song Shuqi lately?

208
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:42,960
She looks miserable.

209
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:48,840
Song Shuqi,

210
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,360
don't be too upset.

211
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,040
Why would I be upset?

212
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,800
Rare things may be hard to find,

213
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,680
but men are everywhere.

214
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:38,280
I got you flowers.

215
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:42,840
They smell amazing.

216
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,920
Zhang Jinghang's sentence came down.

217
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:47,960
Three years.

218
00:10:49,160 --> 00:10:50,160
Our loop

219
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:51,360
can finally end.

220
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:52,880
Why don't I feel any satisfaction

221
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:55,200
now that he's finally been punished?

222
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,320
We did everything we could.

223
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:00,840
Don't dwell on it.

224
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,160
Let's go get something good to eat.

225
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,240
I want to eat at home with you.

226
00:11:04,920 --> 00:11:05,760
I just want

227
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,040
to be safe

228
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,760
and spend a quiet day with you.

229
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:11,600
Okay.

230
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,560
Then I want your pasta.

231
00:11:14,560 --> 00:11:15,120
Sure.

232
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:31,480
It smells amazing.

233
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:33,080
Well then,

234
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:33,960
digging in!

235
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,400
Rehearsal wore you out today, huh?

236
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:45,720
You have no idea. It was exhausting.

237
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:48,040
I have to say,

238
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:52,560
this is Michelin-chef level.

239
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:55,360
After we get married,

240
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,520
whenever you're craving something,

241
00:11:56,920 --> 00:11:57,840
I'll make it for you.

242
00:11:58,400 --> 00:11:58,880
Mm-hmm.

243
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:03,920
Oh, right.

244
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:07,320
I have a little

245
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,040
surprise for you.

246
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:09,160
Wait here.

247
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:10,880
Okay.

248
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:27,920
♪Happy birthday to you♪

249
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:32,200
♪Happy birthday to you♪

250
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:36,640
♪Happy birthday to you♪

251
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:41,200
♪Happy birthday to you♪

252
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:44,560
Wait a second.

253
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:46,120
Let me turn off the lights first.

254
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:47,320
Then make your wish.

255
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:48,040
Okay.

256
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:56,240
I'll make my wish now.

257
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,080
Go ahead.

258
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:02,440
I wish He Lan and I will always
stand by each other

259
00:13:02,760 --> 00:13:03,800
and grow old together.

260
00:13:24,920 --> 00:13:25,520
Xiyu.

261
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:27,800
Xiyu?

262
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:32,920
Xiyu!

263
00:13:33,520 --> 00:13:34,160
Xiyu!

264
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:36,240
No.

265
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:37,120
No.

266
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:38,800
No!

267
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:11,640
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

268
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:18,200
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

269
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:22,320
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

270
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:25,480
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

271
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:28,400
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

272
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:31,880
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

273
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:38,120
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

274
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:44,680
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

275
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:47,960
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

276
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:51,840
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

277
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:54,680
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

278
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:58,800
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

279
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:01,680
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

280
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:05,080
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

281
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,480
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

282
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:11,480
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

283
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:15,560
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

284
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:18,600
♪I could give you another future♪

285
00:15:18,800 --> 00:15:25,040
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

286
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:27,360
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

287
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,000
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

288
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,760
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

289
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:33,040
